1.10 General Objective
To establish and manage a climate-smart indigenous chicken broiler production enterprise that improves production efficiency, enhances profitability, and promotes sustainable livestock farming.
1.11 Specific Objectives
The project aimed to:
1.	Conduct a locality analysis of Thigio area.
2.	Identify challenges affecting poultry production.
3.	Design a climate-smart poultry production system.
4.	Rear indigenous broilers for meat production.
5.	Apply proper feeding and disease control measures.
6.	Maintain accurate farm records.
7.	Add value to poultry products.
8.	Develop marketing strategies.
9.	Assess profitability of the enterprise.
10.	Promote environmental conservation and sustainability.
